{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Generate high-dimensional, unit-normalized semantic embeddings 100% offline on Apple Silicon."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/denselocalembeddings"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Embedding-APIs","title":"Embedding APIs","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/LocalEmbeddingEngine"]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Modern Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and semantic search systems require dense vector representations of text. Traditional approaches depend on remote APIs (e.g. OpenAI) or large multi-gigabyte models that exhaust memory. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftNLP"},{"type":"text","text":" introduces "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"},{"type":"text","text":", a subword N-gram character hashing projection engine that produces deterministic, unit-normalized dense embeddings in sub-millisecond execution times."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"1-Algorithmic-Foundation","text":"1. Algorithmic Foundation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"},{"type":"text","text":" operates through a three-stage mathematical pipeline:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Subword N-gram Hashing","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Text is tokenized into word and character n-grams (sizes 3 to 6). Each n-gram is hashed into a fixed integer space using FNV-1a hash functions."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dimension Projection","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Hashes are projected onto a $D$-dimensional vector space (e.g., $D=128$ or $D=256$) with deterministic sign flips to prevent feature collision bias."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unit $L_2$ Normalization","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The resulting dense vector is projected onto the unit hypersphere:"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"$$v_{\\text{norm}} = \\frac{v}{|v|"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2} = \\frac{v}{\\sqrt{\\sum"}]},{"type":"text","text":"{i=1}^{D} v_i^2}}$$"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because all embeddings have $|v|_2 = 1.0$, the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cosine Similarity"}]},{"type":"text","text":" between two embeddings is equivalent to their direct "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dot Product"}]},{"type":"text","text":", allowing single-instruction vector evaluation via Apple Accelerate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vDSP_dotprD"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"$$\\text{CosineSimilarity}(u, v) = u \\cdot v$$"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"2-Generating-Embeddings","text":"2. Generating Embeddings"},{"code":["import SwiftNLP","","\/\/ Initialize a 128-dimensional local embedding engine","let engine = LocalEmbeddingEngine(dimension: 128)","","\/\/ Generate embedding for a single text snippet","let vector = engine.embed(\"Apple Silicon M3 Max neural network processing\")","print(\"Vector dimension: \\(vector.count)\") \/\/ 128","","\/\/ Batch embedding generation","let documents = [","    \"High-performance computing on macOS\",","    \"Relational database wire protocol drivers\",","    \"Deep convolutional neural networks for vision\"","]","let batchEmbeddings = engine.embedBatch(documents)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"3-Integration-with-SwiftClusterVectorStore","text":"3. Integration with SwiftCluster.VectorStore"},{"code":["import SwiftCluster","","let store = VectorStore(metric: .cosineSimilarity)","","for (idx, doc) in documents.enumerated() {","    let vec = engine.embed(doc)","    store.add(id: \"doc_\\(idx)\", vector: vec, metadata: [\"text\": doc])","}","","\/\/ Perform instant semantic similarity search","let query = engine.embed(\"Mac hardware acceleration\")","let topHits = store.search(query: query, topK: 1)","print(\"Top match: \\(topHits.first?.metadata[\"text\"] ?? \"\")\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/DenseLocalEmbeddings"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftNLP"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Dense Local Text Embeddings with Accelerate","roleHeading":"API Collection"},"references":{"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/LocalEmbeddingEngine":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/localembeddingengine","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalEmbeddingEngine"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LocalEmbeddingEngine","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A lightweight, on-device dense text embedding generator optimized for Apple Silicon.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/LocalEmbeddingEngine","role":"symbol","title":"LocalEmbeddingEngine","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP":{"abstract":[{"text":"Natural Language Processing, Text Feature Extraction & Native Apple NaturalLanguage Integration.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp","title":"SwiftNLP","type":"topic"}}}